# CODEOWNERS
#
# The steward (@kormie) owns the spec canon and the Lean law set. See
# AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md law #4 ("Steward gates") — changes under any of
# these paths require @kormie's review before merge, not just a routine
# approval.
#
# CODEOWNERS syntax notes: patterns are gitignore-style and rooted at the
# repo when prefixed with "/"; "**" matches zero or more path segments;
# the LAST matching pattern in this file wins for a given path (all
# entries below share the same owner, so ordering has no effect here).

# Canonical spec pack (read-only canon; law #1) — any diff here is a spec
# change and must route through the steward's pack-import process.
/spec/**            @kormie

# Spec integrity manifest — must stay byte-consistent with /spec/**.
/spec.sha256         @kormie

# The negatives/regressions bridge — keeps the five attack traces red.
/proofs/Regressions.lean @kormie

# Any other Lean law-set sources under proofs/ (top-level and nested,
# including the generated proofs/Mneme/ mirror).
/proofs/*.lean       @kormie
/proofs/**/*.lean    @kormie

# Proof build targets and pinned Lean toolchain determine which certified
# artifacts CI checks and under which kernel.
/proofs/lakefile.toml @kormie
/proofs/lean-toolchain @kormie

# Lean law-set sources under spec/lean/ — already covered by /spec/**
# above; listed explicitly for clarity per the law-set ownership rule.
/spec/lean/**        @kormie

# The governance contract itself — a PR that weakens a steward gate or
# quietly rewrites the law is exactly what CODEOWNERS exists to catch.
/AGENTS.md           @kormie
/CLAUDE.md            @kormie
/CONTEXT.md           @kormie

# The mechanical enforcement surface — settings.json's deny list and the
# PreToolUse/PostToolUse hooks. A PR that narrows these removes the one
# automated backstop this repo has.
/.claude/settings.json @kormie
/.claude/hooks/**       @kormie

# This file and the integrity checkers it depends on — a PR that edits
# any of these could silently disable the checks the rest of this file
# relies on.
/.github/CODEOWNERS       @kormie
/.github/workflows/ci.yml @kormie
/scripts/verify-spec.sh   @kormie
/scripts/sync-lean.sh     @kormie
/scripts/bootstrap.sh     @kormie
/scripts/install-elan.sh  @kormie
